<GuidePage id="queens1">
<h3 id="queens">QUEENS</h3>
<p>Ah yes, I didn't forget that nice, quiet little seaport village where all the latest trends and items are. It's a nice village. There's the "ruler" of the town, King, whom you need to pay taxes to. There are those lovely vendors that sell fresh fish, water and fruits. Everything you need for a growing boy and girl! Then, there's those weapons, items, and gems/attachment shops to gander at.  Oh, don't forget the ever-popular Leaning Tower plucked straight from Italy.</p>
<p>100% in all three categories of the Georama Analysis and get: Macho Sword!</p>
